      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} An easy test case:\n\n```\n\npublic class BorkedLol : UdonSharpBehaviour\n\n{\n\n    public override void PostLateUpdate()\n\n    {\n\n        var origin = Networking.LocalPlayer.GetTrackingData(VRCPlayerApi.TrackingDataType.Origin);\n\n        Networking.LocalPlayer.TeleportTo(origin.position, origin.rotation,\n\n            VRC_SceneDescriptor.SpawnOrientation.AlignRoomWithSpawnPoint);\n\n    }\n\n}\n\n```\n\nAttach this to a gameobject in a fresh project, and spawn in. On stable, you can move and look around freely. In the beta, you'll find yourself completely stuck in place, only able to look up and down. This behavior can be seen on Desktop.\n\nI am unsure if it occurs in other beta builds, I only learned of this issue today when setting up a prefab I sell (Collar and Leash System) with someone who was running beta - I am usually not running beta myself.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
