  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The Origin tracking point seems to be providing data from before handling the player's rotation in PostLateUpdate. Scripts that rely on TeleportTo and need to apply the post-rotated orientation to allow for player motion are now freezing players in place rotation-wise as a result.\n\nThis has also not been properly tested for Position, nor other tracking points, but may apply there too. I also have not tested on Desktop as of yet, only in VR.",
